    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Overlay (midi-qol):</em> each target's ongoing spells of the slot's level or lower end; for each higher one you make a check with your spellcasting ability (DC 10 plus its level), ending it on a success. A spell ends on that creature only (Sage Advice SA183; the world setting <em>Ending a spell on one creature ends the whole spell</em> ends it everywhere). An effect whose spell level isn't known is the GM's call. Not covered: magical effects that aren't on a creature (an area).</p>",
